<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Thank you for contacting Qantas Freight.<br />
<br />
It is important to ensure dimensions and shipment information is accurate at time of booking. Qantas reserves capacity on aircraft based on the information provided at time of booking. Bookings are fully refundable when cancelled before the latest lodgement time entered at time of booking. Refunds are not available for other cancellations and this includes partial refunds if booked space is not fully utilised. We are unable to comply with your refund request on this occasion.<br />
<br />
Moving forward, if your shipment details change before the latest available lodgement time on your booking, we would recommend cancelling the shipment online, as this will trigger an automatic refund and allow you to rebook with your updated shipment information.<br />
<br />
Please let us know if you need any further information or assistance.<br />
<br />
